  "body_html": "<p>Embrace rustic charm and cozy comfort with this beautiful Dragonfly Patchwork Quilt Set, perfect for adding a touch of warmth and tradition to any bedroom. This versatile quilt set also makes a thoughtful and customizable gift for loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features a delightful Dragonfly Patchwork style, bringing a touch of nature and farmhouse elegance to your home.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, birthdays, or any special occasion, perfect for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your quilt set by selecting size options, adding pillowcases, or including a name for a truly unique touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in a range of sizes to suit your needs: Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102''x91'').</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from soft and durable microfiber polycotton fabric for comfortable use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable for convenience; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for best results. Using a mesh laundry bag is recommended.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes 1 quilt, with the option to add 2 pillowcases.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\\'), King (102''x91'')</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
